{
  "body": "# SexyVoice.ai – Free AI Text-to-Speech & Real-Time Voice Calls

Generate expressive AI speech with emotions in 24+ languages, or talk to AI characters in real time. Free AI voice generator, voice cloning & live voice calls. Start with free credits – no card required.

## Expressive Voices — Limitless Possibilities

Free AI Text-to-Speech & Voice Generator.
Perfect for content creators and storytellers.

[Sign up for Free](https://sexyvoice.ai/en/signup) — No credit card required

## Features

### Live Voice Calls

Have real-time conversations with AI characters, in our voices or one you clone.

### Clone Your Voice

Try the live cloning demo: hear a voice recreated from 10 seconds of audio, speaking naturally in multiple languages.

### Secure & Private

Your voice data is protected with enterprise-grade security. Full control over your privacy, profile and history.

### Natural Voices

Integrate natural emotions — add laughter, sighs, coughs, and more — to create authentic, captivating audio experiences.

### Multi-Language Support

Pick from 20+ unique voices in multiple languages, perfect for your specific needs and preferences.

## Try Our Voice Samples

Listen to voice samples created with our advanced AI technology

## Frequently Asked Questions

Everything you need to know about SexyVoice.ai

### Live AI Calling

#### How does Live AI Calling work?

Tap the call button and you'll be connected instantly to a private AI voice call. You can talk naturally, interrupt, change topics, or listen — your call flows like a real conversation.

#### Can I call a character in my own voice?

Yes. A top-up or subscription payment unlocks saved voices. Create a character and choose "Clone a voice", or use "Save a voice for calls" on the Clone page. Record or upload at least 10 seconds of your voice, then choose it as the character's voice.

#### How much does it cost?

Live calling costs 1000 credits per minute while you're connected.

#### Does calling with a cloned voice cost more?

No. Calls cost 1000 credits per minute whichever voice you choose, and saving a voice is free. Billing starts when the character is ready to talk, not while connecting.

#### How do I get the best clone?

Record 10–30 seconds of one person speaking naturally in a quiet room, with no music or background voices. Longer clips are trimmed to 30 seconds. If the room was noisy, save the voice on the Clone page and tick "Clean up the reference audio". Leave it off for clean recordings, as it can make them sound worse.

#### Can I clone someone else's voice?

Only with their permission. Before cloning, you must confirm that you have the rights to use the voice.

### Voice generation & styles

#### Which languages can I generate speech in?

Language support depends on your voice and model. Gemini 3.8 voices support over 130 languages. Other models have their own language coverage. Choose a voice for your target language and preview how it sounds. Voice cloning has a separate language list below.

#### Can I make a voice speak with a specific accent or style, like British or pirate🏴‍☠️?

Yes! Choose a multilingual voice (e.g., Zephyr) and type the style you want—“British accent,” “pirate voice,” “seductive tone,” etc. The model instantly adapts, and you can refine it with more instructions.

### Voice cloning

#### How does voice cloning work?

Record or upload at least 10 seconds of your voice, or a voice you have permission to use. Our AI uses the sample to recreate how it sounds. Generate speech right away, or save the voice to use again.

#### Can I clone my own voice?

Yes! Record or upload at least 10 seconds of clean audio. You can generate speech from the recording, or save your voice for later if you have bought credits.

#### How is voice cloning priced?

Saving a voice is free once you have made a top-up or subscription payment. Generating speech in a cloned voice uses more credits than our standard voices, and longer scripts use more. Live calls use credits at the call rate. Your dashboard and API share the same credit balance.

#### Which languages are supported for Voice Cloning?

Voice cloning supports the following 28 languages:

🇸🇦 Arabic,
🇪🇸 Catalan,
🇩🇰 Danish,
🇳🇱 Dutch,
🇬🇧 English,
🇫🇮 Finnish,
🇫🇷 French,
🇩🇪 German,
🇬🇷 Greek,
🇮🇱 Hebrew,
🇮🇳 Hindi,
🇭🇺 Hungarian,
🇮🇹 Italian,
🇯🇵 Japanese,
🇰🇷 Korean,
🇲🇾 Malay,
🇨🇳 Mandarin Chinese,
🇳🇴 Norwegian,
🇵🇱 Polish,
🇵🇹 Portuguese,
🇷🇴 Romanian,
🇷🇺 Russian,
🇪🇸 Spanish,
🇰🇪 Swahili,
🇸🇪 Swedish,
🇹🇷 Turkish,
🇺🇦 Ukrainian,
and 🇻🇳 Vietnamese.

#### Can I save my cloned voice and use it again?

Yes. Paid users can save up to 10 voices and reuse them for voice generation or live calls. Select a saved voice on the Clone page to generate speech, or choose it as the voice when creating a character.

### Usage, safety & policies

#### Is my voice data secure?

Saved call voices are private to your account. The voice provider retains the reference so you can reuse the voice. You can delete generated audio files in your dashboard. Account deletion also requests removal of saved voices and their previews.

#### What can I use voice generation for?

Create audio for videos, podcasts, audiobooks, games, courses, and social posts. Only use voices and content you have the rights to use.

### Pricing & access

#### How many credits do I need?

New users get 10,000 free credits. How much speech you can generate depends on the voice, model, and text. Buy credits once with a top-up, or get monthly credits with a subscription. Voice generation and calls use the same balance.

#### Why choose SexyVoice.ai?

We combine premium voice quality with simple tools and fair pricing. Whether you’re a creator or a business, you get professional results without contracts or complicated setups. The free credits make it easy to try everything out.

### API for Developers

#### Do you have an API for developers?

Yes. Our API lets you add voice generation to apps, websites, and games using the same credits as your dashboard. Voice cloning and live calls are available in the web app. See the [documentation](https://docs.sexyvoice.ai).

## Ready to find your voice?

Join thousands of creators who trust our platform for creating realistic emotion-rich speech.

[Create your first voice](https://sexyvoice.ai/en/signup)

